    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "healing? i dont even know if there is anything left to heal. it's not like i'm just sad or something. it's like the foundation is gone. the version of me that actually existed, the one that felt real to the world... that person is dead. and i'm just stuck here performing this charade of being alive when the actual \"me\" is already gone. it feels so pointless.",
