      "content": "it just feels like i'm a hollow shell. like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing will. if the person who mattered is dead, then what am i even doing? why am i still putting in the effort to wake up and pretend to be someone every day? it feels more like a burden than a life at this point.",
